<div class="row">
    <button class="back" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-left: 30px"></button>
</div>

<div class="infoContainer" style="overflow-y: scroll;">
    <div class="px-3 mt-2">
        <h3>Scroll Down within the screen to view the instructions!</h3>
        <p>Spotify's search and recommendation algorithm sucks! Roulette presents a new way to find music through friends and random users via a more organic and natural method.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <div id="infoLoginButton" class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center disabled">Login With Spotify</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>Press the Login button to login through Spotify</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center px-3">
            <form action="/search" method="GET">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center"><h5>Search for a User</h5></div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <input type="text" class="form-control disabled" id="userSearchButton" name="user" placeholder="ex. speedx77" required style="height: 30px">
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                    <input class="mt-2 disabled" type="submit" value="Search" id="userSearch">
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>After signing in, search for a Spotify user, preferably a freind by their user id</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <div class="ms-1" id="idSearch"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>If you don't know your friend's user id, navigate to their profile in a browser window and copy the text after "/user/" in the url bar</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <div class="ms-1" id="idSearch" style="background-image: url('http://localhost:3001/assets/profile-share.jpg');"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>1. You can also navigate to the desired profile and click the share icon</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <div class="ms-1" id="idSearch" style="background-image: url('http://localhost:3001/assets/profile-link.jpg');"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>2. Click on "Copy Link" and paste it into the search box within Roulette</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center px-3">
            <form action="/search" method="GET">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center"><h5>Search for a User</h5></div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <input type="text" class="form-control disabled" id="userSearchButton" name="user" placeholder="https://open.spotify.com/user/speedx77?si=5959025525134013" required style="height: 30px">
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                    <input class="mt-2 disabled" type="submit" value="Search" id="userSearch">
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>3. Once the user id or profile link is in the search bar hit the search button!</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <div class="row d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                <div class="pfp " style="background-image: url('http://localhost:3001/assets/default-speedx77-pfp.jpg')" id="infoCurrentUserPfp"></div> 
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-center" style="font-size: 20px; color: black" id="currentUserDisplayName">Speedx77</div>
            </div> 
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>After searching for your friend click on their profile to begin randomizing their playlists and songs into a delightful 10 song queue!</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <button  class="disabled" id="infoRandomize"> <div id="randomIcon"></div> </button>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center">
            <p>The Randomize Button will redo the randomization for that selected user and create a new queue of 10 songs for you to enjoy!</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-2">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <button class="disabled" id="infoMute"><div id="muteIcon"></div></button>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <p>Mute the player audio</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-5">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <button class="info-center-button disabled"> <div id="infoPlay"></div> </button>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <p>Pause the player song</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-5">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <div id="info-raise-volume"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <p>Increase the player volume</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-5">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <div id="info-lower-volume"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <p>Decrease the player volume</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-5">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <div id="infoSkip"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <p>Skip Current Song</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    <div class=" row align-items-start mt-5">
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <div id="infoPrevious"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
            <p>Go to Previous Song</p>
        </div>  
    </div>
    

</div>


